{"text": " You wake up in 1610 beside the River Thames. It's a cold, misty December morning and the sun hangs low in dim. A man named Thomas Harriet points a telescope straight at it. Don't try this, it can blind you. Did you know that the first telescope drawing of sun spots wasn't made by Galileo? It was this Englishman and he never published it. Two years later in Florence, Galileo watches the spots drift across the sun. Day after day, another astronomer says they're tiny planets passing in front. Galileo says, no, they're on the sun itself and the sun is turning. In 1613, he publishes his letters. The perfect heavenly body has blemishes. Out in the fields, daylight still runs your day. But for a few people with telescopes, the sun has become something to watch closely. And soon someone will ask what's actually inside that light.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.68, "text": " You wake up in 1610 beside the River Thames.", "tokens": [50364, 509, 6634, 493, 294, 3165, 3279, 15726, 264, 8640, 334, 1632, 13, 50526], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12628713250160217, "compression_ratio": 1.5582191780821917, "no_speech_prob": 0.023456359282135963, "words": [{"word": " You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14, "probability": 0.6382876038551331}, {"word": " wake", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.3, "probability": 0.9898082613945007}, {"word": " up", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.5, "probability": 0.9987433552742004}, {"word": " in", "start": 0.5, "end": 0.62, "probability": 0.9819828271865845}, {"word": " 1610", "start": 0.62, "end": 1.52, "probability": 0.9131462872028351}, {"word": " beside", "start": 1.52, "end": 1.92, "probability": 0.7016836404800415}, {"word": " the", "start": 1.92, "end": 2.12, "probability": 0.9604743123054504}, {"word": " River", "start": 2.12, "end": 2.28, "probability": 0.7523831725120544}, {"word": " Thames.", "start": 2.28, "end": 2.68, "probability": 0.9093623757362366}]}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 2.98, "end": 5.22, "text": " I